{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790786100, "covers_from": "2026-09-30T16:35:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-30T16:36:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790786160, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-30T16:35:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 36485, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "環境", "content": "吸煙區的規劃很糟糕！\n帶著小孩走在路上都會吸到「第一手」的二手煙😡", "display_name": "信義代表 No.36,485", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-30T16:35:11+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 41489, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "環境", "content": "路邊的垃圾桶太少,喝完的飲料無法丟", "display_name": "大同代表 No.41,489", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-30T16:35:17+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 14070, "sprite_key": "bear_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "經濟", "content": "我希望未来可以推出更多政策来帮助 经济没有那么好的市民 让大家都可以吃饱饱", "display_name": "大同代表 No.14,070", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-30T16:35:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 28357, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "道路常翻修但紅磚道沒有，很多紅磚道鬆動，踩踏會濺起髒水惡臭，打壞一整天好心情。", "display_name": "中山代表 No.28,357", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-30T16:35:41+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 29549, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "路人抽完菸菸蒂隨手往水溝蓋丟可以怎麼檢舉，吸二手菸就夠火大，看到水溝一堆菸蒂更火大", "display_name": "中山代表 No.29,549", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-30T16:35:55+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 32881, "sprite_key": "turtle_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "長照", "content": "助人工作者也需要被照護。", "display_name": "文山代表 No.32,881", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_